oper has put considerable effort into making the art style appear as harmonious and unified as possible. The game offers visually pleasing and consistent pixel art graphics.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375410/extras/c49bc4c517fd5d1807dc03f73b8241d9.poster.avif?t=1715700720\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375410/extras/c49bc4c517fd5d1807dc03f73b8241d9.webm?t=1715700720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375410/extras/c49bc4c517fd5d1807dc03f73b8241d9.mp4?t=1715700720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>*Since this game was developed by a single person, if you encounter any bugs or errors in translation, please feel free to provide feedback through various channels!<br>*Due to limited energy, the translation work for some languages is still ongoing, please look forward to it!",
